{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"時事全方位｜修訂建築物條例(一)\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/2026-11-23-11-51-03L426pOZX.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】題目：修訂建築物條例</p><p>發展局建議修訂建築物條例，引入指明僭建物定義，提高罰則，同時改革對樓宇維修工程的規管，具體如何執行？</p><p>嘉賓：發展局常任秘書長(規劃及地政)何珮玲</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.943582+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":91,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T05:41:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T19:12:58.404661+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T06:24:46.399654+00:00","content_hash":"c9efad5cb5146b57ada627f341bb1b4560206e31ff569ba07a037a720316a740","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T06:31:28.943582+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}